**Defect 1: `makeManual.mts:17` — Wrong filename when looking up generated test**
```mts
const testFileName = testName;
const genTestFile = path.join(genDir, `${testFileName}`);
```
The generated test files in `genDir` are named `${test.name}_test.go` (per `convertFourslash.mts:70`). If a user runs `npm run makemanual MyTest`, the script looks for `gen/MyTest` but the actual file is `gen/MyTest_test.go` → **file not found error** even though the test exists.
